('UCHsx4Hqa-1ORjQTh9TYDhww','takanashikiara','Takanashi Kiara Ch. hololive-EN','An idol whose dream is to become a fast food shop owner. She is a phoenix, NOT a chicken or turkey. (Very important)\nShe works extremely hard since she will be reborn from ashes anyway.\n\nFor Inquiries\nCover Corp: http://cover-corp.com/\nOfficial Twitter: https://twitter.com/hololive_En',1570000,263841906),
('UCIBY1ollUsauvVi4hW4cumw','sakamatachloe','Chloe ch. 沙花叉クロヱ - holoX -','【2025年01月26日（日）配信活動終了】\n登録したら君も今日から飼育員さん♡\n\n\n+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n\nマジラブ！沙花叉３ヶ条！\n\n・同担遠巻き！\n・迷惑行為絶対禁止！\n・浮気はお掃除対象です！\n\n-------------------------------------------------\n\n【特集】沙花叉クロヱの生態系！\n\n【秘密結社holoX】の掃除屋(インターン生)\n冷静沈着で淡々と組織からの依頼をこなす。\n音楽が好きで、よく音楽を聴いている。\n本人は否定しているが、ツンデレに見られるらしい。\n\n誕生日　５月１８日　身長　１４８センチ\n\n\nAn intern who acts as a fixer and cleaner for Secret Society holoX.\nCalm and composed at all times, she carries out her orders without so much as batting an eyelid.\nShe loves music and can be found listening to it every chance she gets.\nAnd while she denies it vehemently, she apparently tends to come across as guarded and not very upfront with her thoughts, only letting people get very occasional glimpses into how she really feels.\n\n\nBirth day 5/18 　I\'m 148 cm\n',1370000,197622063),
('UCJFZiqLMntJufDCHc6bQixg','hololive','hololive ホロライブ - VTuber Group','English follows Japanese.\n\nVTuber・バーチャルアイドルグループ「ホロライブ」の公式チャンネルへようこそ！\n各タレント・公式チャンネルのチャンネル登録をよろしくお願いします！\n\nホロライブ公式チャンネルでは、3Dショートアニメ『#ホロぐら』や公式動画、所属タレントの企画放送やホロライブの最新情報をお届けします。他、各タレントの動画を横断的に視聴できる再生リストも充実しているので、是非お楽しみください。\n\n▷Twitter\nhttps://twitter.com/hololivetv\n\n▷Schedule\nhttps://schedule.hololive.tv/\n\n▷Official HP\nhttps://hololive.hololivepro.com/\n\n\nWelcome to the official channel of the VTuber Virtual Idol Group \"hololive\"!\nPlease feel free to subscribe to our official channel as well as the channels of our talents!\n\nWithin the hololive official channel, you\'ll find the 3D animation \"#holonoGraffiti\", group event streams, the latest info from hololive, and more!\nWe also have plenty of playlists where you can watch our talents\' videos. Have fun!\n\nIf you translate our videos into your native language, we\'d be grateful!\nhttps://www.youtube.com/timedtext_cs_panel?c=UCJFZiqLMntJufDCHc6bQixg&tab=2',2750000,1572652263),
