('UCMwGHR0BTZuLsmjY_NT5Pwg','ninomaeinanis','Ninomae Ina\'nis Ch. hololive-EN','One day, she picked up a strange book and then started to gain the power of controlling tentacles. To her, tentacles are just a part in her ordinary life; it has never been a big deal for her. However, her girly mind does want to get them dressed up and stay pretty.\n\nAfter gaining power, she started hearing Ancient Whispers and Revelations. Hence, she began her VTuber activities to deliver random sanity checks on humanity, as an ordinary girl.\n\nFor Inquiries\nCover Corp: http://cover-corp.com/\nOfficial Twitter: https://twitter.com/hololive_En',1610000,161306787),
